NEW separate grant. Clients should share the authored file reference so they do not disclose the temporary URL's credential. `filesystem:read` is checked when the URL is minted, not when it is served: a URL issued before the grant was revoked keeps working until it expires, and it is not bound to the session that minted it. Host videos can change in place. Their [HTTP responses](../../apps/server/src/http.ts) omit cache validators because file metadata cannot prove byte-for-byte
